WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.960
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:01.230 --> 01:02.560
Send her to the kitchen.

3
01:02.560 --> 01:04.453
Don't let her come up here.

4
01:04.453 --> 01:07.551
If you ever forget your place, I'll pour it over your face.

5
01:07.551 --> 01:11.200
I have no idea how it video-called you.

6
01:11.200 --> 01:13.080
Just tell Nat to come sign the divorce papers.

7
01:13.080 --> 01:16.240
Do you know of any place that's not too expensive?

8
01:16.240 --> 01:17.600
You can stay at my place.

9
01:17.600 --> 01:18.680
I'm hardly ever home.

10
01:18.680 --> 01:22.710
Giving Nat drugs won't hurt him, right?

11
01:24.200 --> 01:27.000
I've changed my mind. I'm not divorcing him.

12
01:27.000 --> 01:31.308
He doesn't look well, just like you suspected.

13
01:34.808 --> 01:37.306
You have a gentle touch, Kadkao.

14
01:38.316 --> 01:39.711
No wonder...

15
01:40.720 --> 01:43.520
Master speaks so highly of you,

16
01:43.520 --> 01:45.506
saying you're so useful.

17
01:47.240 --> 01:49.724
I'm grateful to you, my lady,

18
01:49.724 --> 01:52.408
for allowing me to serve you.

19
02:00.760 --> 02:03.520
I'm the one who should thank you.

20
02:05.040 --> 02:07.513
But you know something, Kadkao?

21
02:08.920 --> 02:11.703
Master once took in a stray dog.

22
02:12.480 --> 02:16.298
It even brought him a snake that had nearly bitten him.

23
02:17.080 --> 02:19.880
He'd pat it on the head,

24
02:19.880 --> 02:22.311
feed it and care for it fondly.

25
02:24.320 --> 02:28.211
But one day, it forgot its place

26
02:29.000 --> 02:31.720
and climbed onto my bed.

27
02:33.360 --> 02:37.421
Do you know what I did to it?

28
02:40.680 --> 02:42.315
No, ma'am.

29
02:43.360 --> 02:46.800
I ordered the servants to skin it alive,

30
02:46.800 --> 02:49.925
then threw its flesh to the vultures and crows.

31
02:51.360 --> 02:53.428
A plaything is just a plaything.

32
02:54.160 --> 02:56.611
Master may enjoy something new,

33
02:58.360 --> 03:01.106
but your place is on the ground.

34
03:01.680 --> 03:03.896
Don't you dare reach for the treetops.

35
03:04.655 --> 03:06.021
Understand?

36
03:44.320 --> 03:46.296
Yes, Pete?

37
03:46.296 --> 03:48.713
When are you going to sleep upstairs?

38
03:50.400 --> 03:54.413
I know you feel awkward because it's my room.

39
03:58.600 --> 04:02.518
But go ahead and sleep there. You'll be more comfortable.

40
04:03.926 --> 04:07.600
Okay. I'll go up in a bit.

41
04:09.040 --> 04:11.520
I'll just stop by for a few things.

42
04:11.520 --> 04:14.116
I won't be long or bother you.

43
04:15.080 --> 04:16.420
Okay.

44
05:42.920 --> 05:44.480
Looks delicious.

45
05:44.480 --> 05:46.010
Would you like to eat now?

46
05:49.188 --> 05:50.600
How many spoonfuls?

47
05:50.600 --> 05:52.205
One, please.

48
06:59.280 --> 07:00.880
Bastards!

49
07:02.120 --> 07:04.808
I didn't want you to see something like this.

50
07:05.720 --> 07:07.400
But I didn't want to lie.

51
07:11.840 --> 07:14.315
They've been seeing each other for a long time.

52
07:15.120 --> 07:17.598
Even before Pete and I broke up.

53
07:20.920 --> 07:27.040
Is this why you got so drunk and kept saying you wanted to come back?

54
07:29.680 --> 07:31.546
I'm going to sue.

55
07:31.546 --> 07:33.827
Why make things complicated?

56
07:33.827 --> 07:36.993
Yo wants a divorce anyway. Just divorce her.

57
07:36.993 --> 07:40.511
I won't divorce her. I'll sue him for adultery.

58
07:51.600 --> 07:54.778
Pam, if lawyers get involved,

59
07:54.778 --> 07:58.120
the police will find out the clip is AI-generated.

60
07:58.120 --> 07:59.864
That's easy.

61
07:59.864 --> 08:01.613
Just delete the clip.

62
08:03.400 --> 08:08.090
We made it for Nat to see, not anyone else.

63
08:08.090 --> 08:12.814
As for everything else, let Yotaka deal with it herself.

64
08:27.200 --> 08:28.712
I have something to tell you.

65
08:31.240 --> 08:34.506
Pam and Whan took Nat to the great-grandfather's house.

66
08:51.420 --> 08:52.620
Nat!

67
09:01.080 --> 09:02.622
How are you?

68
09:03.400 --> 09:06.813
Fine, I guess. Seeing you cheat on me.

69
09:08.080 --> 09:09.680
You're insulting me.

70
09:09.680 --> 09:12.120
Then why did you move in with him?

71
09:15.080 --> 09:17.822
Didn't think I'd find out, did you?

72
09:22.320 --> 09:25.809
Oh, the other man is here too?

73
09:25.809 --> 09:27.904
Stop being crazy, Nat.

74
09:28.800 --> 09:30.456
You two are inseparable.

75
09:30.456 --> 09:34.310
You must be madly in love.

76
09:37.647 --> 09:40.200
It's good that Yo's found someone else.

77
09:40.200 --> 09:42.584
You should just divorce her.

78
09:42.584 --> 09:45.619
Why waste time suing him for adultery?

79
09:46.680 --> 09:48.830
You're here to talk divorce?

80
09:48.830 --> 09:50.280
Let me make this clear.

81
09:50.280 --> 09:52.288
I'm not divorcing you, no matter what.

82
09:52.288 --> 09:53.828
But I'm suing him.

83
09:53.828 --> 09:55.813
I'll make sure he loses his job.

84
09:58.560 --> 10:00.546
You're talking just fine now.

85
10:00.546 --> 10:02.321
Not drowsy or confused anymore?

86
10:04.120 --> 10:05.838
What do you mean?

87
10:05.838 --> 10:08.028
Are you saying Nat was drugged?

88
10:10.320 --> 10:11.600
Wait, Pam.

89
10:11.600 --> 10:14.914
I never said Nat was drugged.

90
10:18.363 --> 10:20.521
Did you actually drug Nat?

91
10:21.220 --> 10:24.617
Don't make accusations without proof.

92
10:28.010 --> 10:29.438
Nat.

93
10:29.438 --> 10:31.019
Are you okay?

94
10:32.360 --> 10:34.640
The day you left me,

95
10:34.640 --> 10:35.800
I was devastated.

96
10:35.800 --> 10:37.080
I drank a lot.

97
10:37.080 --> 10:38.927
I was completely wasted.

98
10:39.813 --> 10:41.718
You must've misunderstood.

99
10:42.800 --> 10:45.127
No one did anything to me.

100
10:45.127 --> 10:46.617
Except you.

101
10:52.053 --> 10:53.801
I'll see you in court.

102
10:54.600 --> 10:56.306
I'm suing him for adultery.

103
10:59.376 --> 11:01.303
You should go, Yo.

104
11:01.303 --> 11:05.521
The three of us are perfectly happy.

105
11:08.449 --> 11:10.306
Just wait for the summons.

106
11:11.054 --> 11:13.905
Then you'll know how Nat felt

107
11:13.905 --> 11:16.110
when you served him with one.

108
11:27.007 --> 11:28.819
Let me ask you honestly.

109
11:30.177 --> 11:32.504
Is he refusing to let you go,

110
11:33.292 --> 11:37.717
or are you the one who won't leave him?

111
11:47.400 --> 11:49.680
You say there's nothing between you,

112
11:49.680 --> 11:52.080
but you're living together.

113
11:52.080 --> 11:53.600
Getting Nat to believe you

114
11:53.600 --> 11:55.618
won't be easy, Pete.

115
12:09.741 --> 12:12.441
[Police]

116
12:14.549 --> 12:18.007
It wasn't a ghost watching you.

117
12:18.007 --> 12:19.521
It was Whan.

118
12:21.140 --> 12:23.240
Whan has a spare key to my house.

119
12:23.240 --> 12:26.217
She probably snuck in, filmed us, and showed it to Nat.

120
12:27.080 --> 12:30.817
I don't care if Nat gets the wrong idea.

121
12:32.640 --> 12:35.320
What worries me is

122
12:35.320 --> 12:37.200
that Nat was drugged.

123
12:38.020 --> 12:39.706
But we have no evidence.

124
12:41.834 --> 12:47.020
Besides, Pam doesn't seem to be after his assets or his life.

125
12:47.840 --> 12:50.820
So your suspicion may be unfounded.

126
13:15.520 --> 13:19.000
If you truly love Master, you must leave this place.

127
13:19.000 --> 13:22.840
I can't leave yet. I care about Master Lert.

128
13:22.840 --> 13:25.680
He'd be touched to hear that.

129
13:25.680 --> 13:30.432
But I can't forgive a traitor like you.

130
13:39.360 --> 13:41.430
Bulan, don't!

131
13:56.640 --> 13:58.219
My lady...

132
14:14.000 --> 14:17.718
Here. You can have Master's heart.

133
14:41.160 --> 14:45.280
From what you've told me, your wife moved in with another man.

134
14:45.280 --> 14:48.880
And they've been seen going out together regularly.

135
14:48.880 --> 14:54.115
But there's still no clear evidence of a sexual relationship, correct?

136
14:54.800 --> 14:57.293
Isn't that enough for me to sue?

137
14:57.293 --> 15:02.053
Then I'll have a private detective take photos and videos

138
15:02.053 --> 15:06.513
clearly showing they're romantically involved.

139
15:07.726 --> 15:12.000
But there's one important thing I need you to confirm.

140
15:12.000 --> 15:16.440
You've never harmed or harassed your wife in any way.

141
15:16.440 --> 15:18.760
She left me for him.

142
15:18.760 --> 15:20.415
She should be held responsible.

143
15:22.160 --> 15:24.718
Please handle everything.

144
15:24.718 --> 15:27.415
Nat just wants justice.

145
15:28.440 --> 15:31.174
Then I'll have someone start following them today.

146
15:31.174 --> 15:32.597
But let me be clear.

147
15:32.597 --> 15:37.600
That deleted clip must never resurface.

148
15:38.400 --> 15:42.712
Otherwise, this whole thing could come back on you.

149
15:44.040 --> 15:46.116
You can count on that.

150
15:47.920 --> 15:50.415
If there's nothing else, I'll take my leave.

151
16:02.895 --> 16:05.491
Why did you delete the clip you showed me?

152
16:05.491 --> 16:07.718
We could've used it as evidence.

153
16:09.640 --> 16:12.594
Because I knew how painful it was for you to see.

154
16:12.594 --> 16:14.554
I didn't want you dwelling on it.

155
16:14.554 --> 16:15.922
Even so,

156
16:15.922 --> 16:17.812
you shouldn't have deleted it.

157
16:27.334 --> 16:29.120
He's suing Pete for adultery.

158
16:29.120 --> 16:32.215
Isn't Nat going to do anything about Yo?

159
16:36.603 --> 16:39.314
I think Nat has his own way of dealing with his wife.

160
17:09.840 --> 17:10.874
Well?

161
17:10.874 --> 17:12.960
It's done, sir.

162
17:12.960 --> 17:15.809
Good. I'll transfer the money.

163
17:16.960 --> 17:18.733
Where's my wife's car now?

164
17:18.733 --> 17:21.016
It's parked outside the police station, sir.

165
17:29.160 --> 17:30.520
Police!

166
17:33.800 --> 17:36.902
I want to get Nat tested for any drugs in his system.

167
17:39.720 --> 17:41.480
Even if Nat was drugged,

168
17:41.480 --> 17:43.160
it's been several days.

169
17:43.160 --> 17:45.020
A test won't find anything.

170
17:48.120 --> 17:50.001
Unless...

171
17:50.001 --> 17:51.318
Unless what?

172
17:51.318 --> 17:52.712
Test his hair.

173
18:10.241 --> 18:16.230
[Yo]

174
18:18.659 --> 18:20.640
What's up, Yo?

175
18:20.640 --> 18:23.306
Can I have a strand of your hair for testing?

176
18:24.135 --> 18:25.520
Sure.

177
18:27.600 --> 18:29.600
Then let's meet somewhere.

178
18:31.600 --> 18:33.829
Pam and Whan aren't home.

179
18:33.829 --> 18:36.023
Why don't you come over?

180
18:36.023 --> 18:37.617
I'm not feeling well.

181
18:45.720 --> 18:47.019
Okay.

182
18:57.040 --> 18:59.520
Nat agreed to the test.

183
18:59.520 --> 19:02.320
I'm going to meet him at his great-grandfather's house.

184
19:07.320 --> 19:08.560
Pete.

185
19:08.560 --> 19:11.620
Aunt Win just called. Her nephew's out of the hospital.

186
19:13.120 --> 19:14.828
Want to go?

187
19:14.828 --> 19:16.104
Let's go.

188
19:19.480 --> 19:20.904
Thank you.

189
19:25.880 --> 19:29.200
I swear Keng isn't crazy.

190
19:29.200 --> 19:32.680
He was hospitalized because of the stress.

191
19:32.680 --> 19:34.590
He's afraid to sleep.

192
19:34.590 --> 19:38.028
Every time he does, he dreams of them.

193
19:40.239 --> 19:42.211
What does he dream about?

194
19:43.680 --> 19:45.360
Same as before.

195
19:45.360 --> 19:48.030
Those three keep asking him for help.

196
19:48.030 --> 19:52.316
They want someone to take their place so they can break the curse.

197
19:52.316 --> 19:56.824
Otherwise, they'll torment him to death real soon.

198
20:01.960 --> 20:05.200
You told me not to get involved.

199
20:05.200 --> 20:08.068
If I keep the precepts and dedicate merit to them,

200
20:08.068 --> 20:11.118
could it lessen the harm to Nat?

201
21:05.760 --> 21:06.960
What's up, Nat?

202
21:06.960 --> 21:09.401
You said you'd come see me yesterday.

203
21:11.000 --> 21:12.520
Something came up.

204
21:12.520 --> 21:15.895
Hiding out at home with that cop is business?

205
21:16.880 --> 21:19.112
I don't want to argue, Nat.

206
21:19.680 --> 21:22.426
Once I'm done, I'll come see you.

207
21:31.960 --> 21:33.222
Yo.

208
21:36.600 --> 21:38.624
May I share in your merit.

209
21:41.320 --> 21:43.386
If you see or sense anything,

210
21:43.386 --> 21:45.104
you have to stay focused.

211
21:48.147 --> 21:50.320
I'll be working out of town for a few days.

212
21:50.320 --> 21:53.520
Call me anytime.

213
21:53.520 --> 21:56.918
I'll leave your car here in case you need it.

214
21:59.139 --> 22:00.615
Thank you.

215
22:10.720 --> 22:13.920
The merit I've made this time,

216
22:13.920 --> 22:16.989
I dedicate to all those...

217
22:16.989 --> 22:22.304
whom my husband Nat Thanahirankit has wronged.

218
22:23.080 --> 22:26.080
May you receive this merit

219
22:26.080 --> 22:28.920
and forgive him.

220
22:28.920 --> 22:32.106
May there be no more vengeance or karma between you and him.

221
22:34.680 --> 22:36.200
I don't want your merit!

222
22:36.200 --> 22:38.213
You have to die!

223
22:38.213 --> 22:39.240
Bastard Lert!

224
22:39.240 --> 22:42.504
You must die and take our place!

225
23:06.886 --> 23:09.273
It's been three days and nights.

226
23:09.273 --> 23:12.413
Master Lert's been in his room with Kadkao.

227
23:19.640 --> 23:20.925
Who is it?

228
23:20.925 --> 23:22.006
Stop knocking!

229
23:22.006 --> 23:23.720
Are you asking for trouble?

230
23:27.733 --> 23:31.615
Oh! Bulan. Why are you back so soon?

231
23:33.440 --> 23:35.611
I was worried about you.

232
23:36.487 --> 23:38.306
Why worry?

233
23:41.880 --> 23:44.108
Kadkao is here to take care of me.

234
23:45.080 --> 23:50.466
You can stay with your father until he's fully recovered.

235
23:50.466 --> 23:51.587
And Bulan,

236
23:51.587 --> 23:54.118
make sure no one disturbs me again.

237
23:55.160 --> 23:58.440
Sroi, bring me my tonic.

238
23:59.080 --> 24:00.420
Yes, sir.

239
24:10.680 --> 24:12.640
Master Lert.

240
24:12.640 --> 24:15.000
My lady is back.

241
24:15.000 --> 24:17.817
Let her take care of you now.

242
24:19.560 --> 24:21.163
I love you.

243
24:21.163 --> 24:23.601
You're the only one I want, Kadkao.

244
24:58.720 --> 25:02.432
I replaced his tonic with poisonous herbs, just as you ordered.

245
25:07.040 --> 25:10.800
Master Lert won't have the strength to desire Kadkao anymore.

246
25:11.480 --> 25:13.280
But...

247
25:13.280 --> 25:14.500
What?

248
25:15.120 --> 25:19.840
The herbalist said if Master Lert drinks too much,

249
25:19.840 --> 25:22.401
it could kill him.

250
25:24.200 --> 25:27.646
If he insists on being so obsessed with Kadkao,

251
25:27.646 --> 25:31.601
then whether he lives or dies is his problem.

252
25:50.120 --> 25:52.100
Did you hear that too, Sroi?

253
26:17.001 --> 26:18.341
Master.

254
26:18.341 --> 26:20.420
Here is your tonic.

255
26:31.000 --> 26:34.523
Kadkao, where are my snacks?

256
26:40.440 --> 26:42.413
What happened to your foot?

257
26:52.160 --> 26:54.502
I stepped on a piece of metal.

258
26:57.400 --> 27:00.931
Sroi, get some medicine for Kadkao.

259
27:01.674 --> 27:03.003
Yes, sir.

260
27:36.080 --> 27:37.811
Your tonic, sir.

261
27:56.400 --> 27:58.331
What's wrong with you?

262
28:02.520 --> 28:04.518
I asked what's wrong.

263
28:05.840 --> 28:08.173
I accidentally knocked it over, sir.

264
28:08.173 --> 28:11.220
I'll make you another tonic, sir.

265
28:12.280 --> 28:14.125
No need.

266
28:14.125 --> 28:15.820
I can drink this.

267
28:34.113 --> 28:35.900
Does it hurt badly?

268
28:55.040 --> 28:57.800
Hmm. I feel refreshed.

269
28:57.800 --> 28:59.916
Thank you so much, Bulan.

270
29:08.973 --> 29:13.007
Sroi, tend to Kadkao's wound as well.

271
29:33.560 --> 29:35.316
This tonic really works.

272
29:36.340 --> 29:38.321
Give some to Kadkao too.

273
29:42.000 --> 29:43.603
Yes.

274
30:27.320 --> 30:29.918
Master is so kind to you.

275
30:36.240 --> 30:37.611
Drink it.

276
31:08.200 --> 31:09.800
Kadkao.

277
31:09.800 --> 31:11.309
What's wrong?

278
31:11.960 --> 31:13.401
Kadkao!

279
31:16.880 --> 31:18.211
Kadkao!

280
31:20.880 --> 31:21.960
Kadkao!

281
31:21.960 --> 31:23.807
What's wrong, Kadkao?

282
31:28.680 --> 31:32.811
Kadkao, what's happening to you?

283
31:34.720 --> 31:39.417
The tonic you ordered must be too strong for Kadkao.

284
31:40.189 --> 31:43.439
I warned you, but you wouldn't listen.

285
31:43.439 --> 31:44.760
You only cared about having fun.

286
31:44.760 --> 31:49.322
If Kadkao dies, it'll be because of your order.

287
31:50.520 --> 31:51.822
Kadkao!

288
31:53.118 --> 31:54.407
Kadkao!

289
31:58.080 --> 31:59.414
Kadkao!

290
32:00.160 --> 32:01.214
Kadkao!

291
32:02.880 --> 32:05.296
Kadkao! Kadkao!

292
32:43.560 --> 32:46.834
You're just going to let her be happy with her lover?

293
32:46.834 --> 32:48.410
Lock her up.

294
32:49.160 --> 32:51.410
Make her yours forever.

295
32:51.410 --> 32:53.214
Just like you did before.

296
33:40.613 --> 33:42.303
Am I seeing things?

297
33:45.560 --> 33:47.112
Idiot.

298
34:15.775 --> 34:17.775
[Nat Thanahirankit] [Yotaka]

299
34:34.520 --> 34:39.911
The attendant nun said she heard you crying out all night.

300
34:42.120 --> 34:45.891
I dreamed about the past.

301
34:45.891 --> 34:47.716
I saw what happened.

302
34:48.869 --> 34:50.705
Everyone has their own karma.

303
34:51.560 --> 34:54.196
Anyway, I wish you well.

304
35:36.760 --> 35:38.320
A GPS tracker.

305
35:42.640 --> 35:44.906
Why did you give her the house?

306
35:44.906 --> 35:47.216
How could you do this to me?

307
35:48.320 --> 35:49.621
You're horrible!

308
35:49.621 --> 35:51.238
You're the worst!

309
35:51.238 --> 35:52.440
Hey! Wait!

310
35:52.440 --> 35:54.840
Pam, calm down.

311
35:54.840 --> 35:56.120
Stop! Don't do this.

312
35:56.120 --> 35:58.406
What are you doing? Stop!

313
36:00.440 --> 36:02.021
This is none of your business.

314
36:02.592 --> 36:05.313
- Nat is my husband. - So what?

315
36:08.040 --> 36:12.518
Wait! Stop! Stop!

316
36:17.640 --> 36:19.606
Get out of my house. Now!

317
36:20.480 --> 36:21.860
Your house?

318
36:21.860 --> 36:24.000
Yes, my house!

319
36:24.000 --> 36:27.413
Get out! And don't ever come back!

320
36:29.760 --> 36:33.320
Wait! I said stop!

321
36:43.920 --> 36:45.920
Pam, stop!

322
36:45.920 --> 36:47.203
That's enough!

323
36:47.203 --> 36:49.508
Have you both lost your minds?

324
36:54.120 --> 36:55.705
Pam, that's enough!

325
36:58.160 --> 37:00.620
Enough! I said stop!

326
37:01.280 --> 37:03.200
You're taking her side?

327
37:04.693 --> 37:05.913
Get out!

328
37:07.400 --> 37:09.116
I said get out!

329
37:10.680 --> 37:12.011
Get out!

330
37:17.443 --> 37:20.715
You'll regret treating me like this.

331
37:35.419 --> 37:36.708
Yo.

332
37:49.320 --> 37:51.108
Have some water, Yo.

333
38:07.280 --> 38:09.206
Are you okay?

334
38:11.680 --> 38:13.520
What's going on?

335
38:13.520 --> 38:15.513
Just tell me the truth.

336
38:17.680 --> 38:21.113
Pam misunderstood something about the house.

337
38:21.799 --> 38:23.308
What about the house?

338
38:24.160 --> 38:27.505
She saw your name on the title deed.

339
38:28.794 --> 38:31.908
Did she misunderstand, or did you let her?

340
38:37.720 --> 38:39.003
Nat.

341
38:40.186 --> 38:42.640
If Pam really drugged you,

342
38:42.640 --> 38:44.821
I'll do everything I can to help you.

343
38:45.529 --> 38:47.713
But you have to tell me the truth.

344
38:53.000 --> 38:54.706
I believe you.

345
38:55.886 --> 38:57.815
I believe you won't leave me.

346
39:00.840 --> 39:04.820
You want my hair tested? You want a blood test? I'll do it.

347
39:04.820 --> 39:06.263
You want to find out who drugged me?

348
39:06.263 --> 39:07.723
I'll let you.

349
39:09.600 --> 39:11.010
But Yo...

350
39:12.760 --> 39:15.016
you'll come back to me, right?

351
39:18.440 --> 39:21.115
Yo... Yo...

352
39:33.640 --> 39:34.815
You...

353
39:35.640 --> 39:38.198
You drugged me...

354
39:57.148 --> 39:58.200
You choose.

355
39:58.200 --> 40:02.725
Will you fight back, or die like before, Kadkao?

356
40:02.725 --> 40:04.433
Yo's spirit isn't in her body.

357
40:04.433 --> 40:06.220
You mean...

358
40:10.800 --> 40:13.480
You'll suffer a thousand times more than I did.

359
40:13.480 --> 40:14.718
Yo!

360
40:19.180 --> 40:21.108
Keep your voice down.

361
40:22.072 --> 40:24.721
Or hell might find you.
